4.1 Palindrome Check
Example:
madam
Compare:
m           m
↓           ↓
left       right

a           a

d
Code:
bool isPalindrome(string s){

   int i = 0;
   int j = s.length() - 1;

   while(i < j){

       if(s[i] != s[j])
           return false;

       i++;
       j--;
   }

   return true;
}
Complexity
Time  = O(n)
Space = O(1)

